{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"851195612049309766","content":"Nolan takes note of the pores and detail now that it is clean. He begins to feel slightly uneasy but isn’t sure why.","created_at":"2021-07-13T18:35:01.500000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864575664686628925","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
